{
  "Name": "DiskBoss Enterprise GET Buffer Overflow",
  "Description": "This module exploits a stack-based buffer overflow vulnerability in the web interface of DiskBoss Enterprise v7.5.12, v7.4.28, and v8.2.14, caused by improper bounds checking of the request path in HTTP GET requests sent to the built-in web server. This module has been tested successfully on Windows XP SP3 and Windows 7 SP1.",
